Fictional EP Tracklist

Track 1: Tallow Candles Braid the Exhaust
- Story & Context: When an emergency power trip severed the main lift cables at Gallery Seven, foreman Walter struck a beef-tallow candle against the damp coal wall and ordered the boys to start the air-hammer count to keep toxic damp from pooling. Nineteen-year-old apprentice Jaro took a rubber mallet to the corrugated zinc ventilation duct, establishing an unswerving eighty-beat motorik clatter while Walter blew long, calming contrabass tuba notes that vibrated the workers' chest cavities like a warm hearth. The crew instinctively began tossing synchronized, old-skool block party routines into the pipe openings to gauge each other's alertness, their rhymes bouncing back with velvet-smooth tube delay until everyone forgot the elevator was dead. "Rock the tin, spit the heat, two miles down where the two winds meet," echoed the five-man chorus through the shaft, christening the sound before the rescue drill ever broke ground.
